Bind Npc 31568 Zone 11 for karus
Bind Npc 31567 Zone 12 for elmorad
Quest 675 "Order of the Sorcery"
    Journal for karus "You must talk to the [Leader of Order of the Sorcery] Malas."
    Journal for elmorad "You must talk to the [Leader of Order of the Sorcery] Felor."

Requires player level >= 65

Rewards none

On available
    Say "Have you heard of [Magic Soceity]? That name sounds really cool. They are upto something in Islant. Let's go find out."
    Topic "All right, I'll swing by" goto close

On offer
    If player is karus
        Say "Who are you? Are you the great knight, <selfname>?"
        Topic "Tell me more..." do
            Say "Sorry for the late introduction. I'm Malas doing the little that I could as the [Leader of Associate of Magic] of the proud [Order of the Sorcery]."
            Topic "Tell me more..." do
                Show quest "It's so great to see you. I was just in need of a skilled warrior. Would you ease our mind by helping us?\n\nDo not su to talk a bit of magic Eslant Phalanx refurbished."
    If player is elmorad
        Say "Who are you? Are you the great knight, <selfname>?"
        Topic "Tell me more..." do
            Say "Sorry for the late introduction. I'm Paltro doing the little that I could as the [Leader of Associate of Magic] of the proud [Order of the Sorcery]."
            Topic "Tell me more..." do
                Show quest "It's so great to see you. I was just in need of a skilled warrior. Would you ease our mind by helping us?\n\nEslant updated dialogue and a Fellow refurbished Magic Phalanx] [Le."

On claimable
    If player is karus
        Show quest "You are as valiant as I heard. Please help us with the mission given to my subordinate Cesar of [Order of the Sorcery] and [Chief Researcher] Gaz."
    If player is elmorad
        Show quest "You are as valiant as I heard. Please help us with the mission given to my subordinate Reisa of [Order of the Sorcery] and [Chief Researcher] Aldos."
